=== Dark patterns in products
Deceptive or manipulative design patterns to benefit company at expense of the users.

1. Fake Urgency: 'only $n$ items left'
2. Sneak into basket: adding items to cart without consent
3. Hidden costs: unexpected costs added at the last step (eg. budget flights service fees)
4. Forced continuity: cannot cancel easily
5. Confirmshaming: uses guilt to manipulate users
6. Roach motel: easy to sign up, hard to get out of

